  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_005, RNA-only multiprofile with scvi_n200 and avgpool, reaching 0.650 accuracy and 0.628 F1, while image-only resnet50 is weak and multimodal settings would introduce multiple new factors. config_006 tests the same RNA encoder and multiprofile setting but replaces avgpool with transformer aggregation, directly isolating the effect of aggregation in the currently most promising design. This is the best next experiment because it exploits the strongest evidence, may improve validation accuracy, and clarifies whether a more expressive aggregation is worthwhile before adding image or fusion complexity."
